WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.885
Mastery Starter 14.0.

00:00:02.885 --> 00:00:05.050
New to Automation & Mastery?

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:06.110
Start here.

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:08.197
In about ten minutes, you'll go from

00:00:08.197 --> 00:00:09.890
zero to ready for this module.

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:15.022
At mastery, you watch everything automatically and act through

00:00:15.022 --> 00:00:18.850
rules and limited permissions, never by handing over keys.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:21.180
Then you prove it with the operator capstone.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:26.035
Alert: an automatic notification tied to an action.

00:00:26.035 --> 00:00:29.595
Keeper: an automated service that executes conditions.

00:00:29.595 --> 00:00:32.870
Session key: a limited, revocable permission.

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:36.770
Change control: a written, delayed process for new risks.

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:40.275
RPC: a connection that lets software read the chain.

00:00:41.575 --> 00:00:43.490
Modules 0–13.

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:47.270
Set one alert today: a health factor, a

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:49.875
peg or any outflow from your vault wallet.

00:00:51.175 --> 00:00:53.785
Beginner: Has alerts mapped to actions.

00:00:53.785 --> 00:00:56.594
Practitioner: Automates one task with scoped

00:00:56.594 --> 00:00:59.515
permissions and writes signing procedures.

00:00:59.515 --> 00:01:03.830
Master: Builds read-only tools and passes the operator capstone.

00:01:05.130 --> 00:01:06.880
You've mastered this module when

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:08.790
you've passed the operator capstone.

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:12.605
Do the checklist now, before you move on.

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:15.258
Next up, Lesson 14.1: Monitoring:

00:01:15.258 --> 00:01:18.457
dashboards, alerts and on-chain watchers.
